> Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n> \r\n> The dock can't be moved to the side by design, but you can turn it into a floating window, which is useful to make it taller:\r\n> \r\n> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1079\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/180032/521449685-ceb775f5-21ee-4b1d-b926-cc6237055df4.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjQ3NDUwMTYsIm5iZiI6MTc2NDc0NDcxNiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xODAwMzIvNTIxNDQ5Njg1LWNlYjc3NWY1LTIxZWUtNGIxZC1iOTI2LWNjNjIzNzA1NWRmNC5wbmc_.6Vn5DullJtmDsi_BSLWpBiUCNSHgzDI_gikEAItLRZQ\">\r\n\r\nIf we talk about its size, then it can still be fitted into editor sides with some changes. The minimum width is limited by the top panel of this dock, and after reducing it (for quick testing, I just removed the text from all the buttons), the panel fits pretty well into the side panels.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"972\" height=\"570\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ceb7637-5565-4840-8bc3-2ee4d650e0ae\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3605385103/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]